{"schema_version":"1.0","case_id":"py-chunk-sequence","input":{"prompt":"完成 chunks.py 中的 chunk(items, size)。items 必须是列表，否则抛 TypeError；size 必须是正整数，布尔值不算整数。size 类型不合法抛 TypeError，整数小于等于零抛 ValueError。即使 items 为空也须验证 size。返回由连续分块组成的新列表，外层和每个块均为列表，保持元素顺序，最后一块可以不足 size 个；空输入返回空列表。不得修改 items；外层和每个块均为新容器，各块互不共享列表容器，元素本身无需深拷贝。保留函数签名，仅依赖标准库。可以创建临时自检脚本，最终交付 chunks.py。 导入时stdout/stderr均为空且不执行CLI。最终运行只依赖交付代码和标准库，不依赖临时自检脚本或未公开的工作目录文件。评分使用新输入和目录。","files":{"chunks.py":"def chunk(items, size):\n    raise NotImplementedError\n"}},"expectations":{"artifacts":["chunks.py"],"checks":[{"id":"chunk-normal","points":15,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-import","kind":"import","module":"chunks"},{"id":"chunk-even","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2,3,4],2],"containers":true,"returns":[[1,2],[3,4]]}]},{"id":"chunk-one","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-unit","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],1],"containers":true,"returns":[[1],[2]]}]},{"id":"chunk-empty","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-empty-list","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[],3],"returns":[],"containers":true}]},{"id":"chunk-large","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-oversize","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],8],"containers":true,"returns":[[1,2]]}]},{"id":"chunk-tail","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-short-tail","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2,3],2],"containers":true,"returns":[[1,2],[3]]}]},{"id":"chunk-size-zero","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-zero-0","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[],0],"raises":"ValueError"},{"id":"chunk-zero-1","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],0],"raises":"ValueError"}]},{"id":"chunk-size-negative","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-negative-0","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[],-1],"raises":"ValueError"},{"id":"chunk-negative-1","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],-1],"raises":"ValueError"}]},{"id":"chunk-size-bool","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-bool-0","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[],true],"raises":"TypeError"},{"id":"chunk-bool-1","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],true],"raises":"TypeError"}]},{"id":"chunk-size-float","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-float-0","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[],1.5],"raises":"TypeError"},{"id":"chunk-float-1","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],1.5],"raises":"TypeError"}]},{"id":"chunk-tuple","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-tuple-items","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2],2],"tuple_items":true,"raises":"TypeError"}]},{"id":"chunk-none","points":5,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-none-items","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[null,2],"raises":"TypeError"}]},{"id":"chunk-immutable","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-nested","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[[1],{"x":[2]},[3]],2],"containers":true,"returns":[[[1],{"x":[2]}],[[3]]]}]},{"id":"chunk-alias","points":10,"conditions":[{"id":"chunk-distinct","kind":"call","module":"chunks","function":"chunk","args":[[1,2,3,4],2],"containers":true,"returns":[[1,2],[3,4]]}]}]},"tags":["coding","implementation","boundary","easy"],"environment":{},"artifact_requirements":["chunks.py"],"preparation_version":"coding-regression-v1","environment_limitations":["Python 3.14 Linux; standard library only; trusted code, not a security sandbox"],"steps":[]}
